Return prose, not JSON. Begin with exactly four short decision lines: DISPOSITION: ACCEPT|REVISE|REFUSE; PUBLISHABLE: YES|NO; FAILURE_LAYER: sources|assignment|instructions|deterministic-gates|writer-model|draft-repair|none; REPLAY_FROM: <layer>. Then write sections headed SUMMARY:, FINDINGS:, CLAIM AUDIT:, REQUIRED REPAIRS:, PIPELINE EVIDENCE:, and PIPELINE IMPROVEMENT:. End with END REPORT:. The four decision lines are machine-picked; all substantive judgment stays prose.

